 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Moses the servant of the Lord is dead",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now get up and cross this Jordan",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Every place where the sole of your foot treads",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have given you just as promised",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the wilderness to the great sea",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All this shall be your territory",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No one will be able to stand against you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As I was with Moses so I will be with you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be strong and courageous",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For you will give this people possession",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be terrified or dismayed",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord your God is with you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Joshua and Caleb tore their clothes",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saying the land is exceedingly good",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If the Lord delights in us",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will bring us into this land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Flowing with milk and honey",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their protection is gone and the Lord is with us",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not fear them",
